na","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","review_id":"NGcvs5Epg6hn8mdM4gYYyQ","date":"2018-05-23T16:16:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9370732307434082,"text_excerpt":"This place was extremely busy last Saturday night but we wandered in on a whim. It is such a beautiful place. I will definitely come back again to try the food. My cocktail was amazing. I believe I ordered the Flor de Jamaica and I can't remember what my friend ordered. The bartenders were genuinely kind people. It was such a warming feeling having someone sweet attending to you despite how slammed they were."},{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","review_id":"3xJ-17u0Qg19eDPfK5AmOQ","date":"2015-02-07T05:11:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9361380338668823,"text_excerpt":"I had a memorable time at Cane & Table, which is saying a lot considering how much I drank during and after my visit there. We went on a weeknight and it was not crowded at all. It has an Old World, romantic look but a sophistication rarely encountered in the French Quarter. We both had cocktails, mine a finger of dark brown something or other in a rocks glass, his in a large ceramic whale with a straw (the Indian Summer). I can't remember the name of my drink, but it was supposed to be piney and manly. It tasted a little like root beer, but it was okay. I actually preferred the contents of the whale. (I think the cocktail menu is a bit heavy on the medicinal Italian digestifs at present...."},{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","review_id":"v0lSfPWv7TjsXTzlbSXL3w","date":"2018-05-25T17:05:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9299527406692505,"text_excerpt":"Disclaimer: this review is based solely on drinks although the food menu looked great. Strolled into this lovely place last night around 10 pm and I stayed until I was the last one. The drinks were perfect and the atmosphere was so devastatingly lovely. I ordered one of their signature cocktails which had a sexy name and the flavor was unique and tantalizingly. The bartenders were polite and attentive. My remaining two drinks were my usual whiskey waters but even they felt elevated. Moral of the story: Cane & Table is the epitome of what a sexy spooky french quarter bar should be. Can't wait to come back soon."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","photo_id":"BVvMUNhTG0v_D8w4xaeayw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BVvMUNhTG0v_D8w4xaeayw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9045494794845581},{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","photo_id":"znwnzlxA5G-yHeKJiPuupA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/znwnzlxA5G-yHeKJiPuupA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.870186448097229},{"business_id":"WOdqMURCc0CHXUllPZwpqQ","